    "updated_at": "2025-06-19T13:56:16Z",
    "body": "another reason, it's a *live collection*, not a static one, and for short-living content (as that's what nodes in fragments do) makes (imho) very little sense to have, it would add instead confusion about suddenly empty lists on append as there are tons of people that still don't know *live collections* exist.",
